 The CA and leaf keys are RFC 8032 section 7.1, TEST 1 and TEST 2. The RSA key and its PSS (32-byte salt) and
 PKCS#1 v1.5 SHA-256 signatures over the server CertificateVerify content for the transcript hash 1..32 were made
 and self-verified by .NET RSA, 2026-10-31.

